        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CF-909, 3\" Distressed Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in the most popular finishes including satin nickel and oil rubbed bronze (pictured right), this cabinet cup pull handle has a simple design that is sturdy as well as timeless. Depending on which of the 6 available finishes you choose, this Distressed Cup Pull would look great in traditional as well as more modern decors. It is easy to clean, easy to install, and easy to love.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CF-909 Simple Cup Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TR100_size.gif?v=1704354719\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
